[TITLE]
Data object editor routing. The conduit and time series share the ID C1.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS CFS
FLOW_ROUTING DYNWAVE

[JUNCTIONS]
J1 10 5

[OUTFALLS]
OUT1 8 FREE

[CONDUITS]
C1 J1 OUT1 100 0.016 0 0

[XSECTIONS]
C1 STREET ST1 0 0 0 1

[COORDINATES]
J1 0 0
OUT1 100 0

[CURVES]
CurveA STORAGE 0 0
CurveA 1 2
CurveB STORAGE 0 0
CurveB 1 3

[TIMESERIES]
TSA 01/01/2026 0:00 1
C1  01/01/2026 0:00 2

[PATTERNS]
FirstPattern MONTHLY 1
LastPattern DAILY 1

[RAINGAGES]
G1 INTENSITY 0:15 1 TIMESERIES TSA

[HYDROGRAPHS]
GroupA G1
GroupA ALL SHORT .1 1 2 .5 .2 .1
GroupB G1
GroupB ALL SHORT .1 1 2 .5 .2 .1

[CONTROLS]
RULE RuleA
IF NODE J1 DEPTH > 1
THEN CONDUIT C1 STATUS = CLOSED

RULE RuleB
IF NODE J1 DEPTH > 2
THEN CONDUIT C1 STATUS = CLOSED

[TRANSECTS]
NC .04 .04 .03
X1 Profile 3 0 0 0 0 1 1 0
GR 10 0 5 5 10 10

[STREETS]
ST1 20 .5 4 .016 0 0 1 0 0 0
ST2 25 .5 4 .016 0 0 1 0 0 0

[INLETS]
GRATE1 GRATE 2 2 P_BAR-50
CURB1 CURB 3 .5 VERTICAL

[POLLUTANTS]
TSS MG/L 0 0 0 0 NO * 0 0 0

[LANDUSES]
Residential 0 0 0

[AQUIFERS]
AQ1 .5 .15 .30 .1 12 15 .35 14 .002 0 3.5 .40

[SNOWPACKS]
Snow PLOWABLE 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
Snow IMPERVIOUS 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
Snow PERVIOUS 0 0 0 0 0 0 0

[LID_CONTROLS]
Stack NODE
Stack SURFACE 6 .1
Stack MEDIA 12 .45 .2 .08 .01 10 3
Stack AGGREGATE 6 .4 100
